{"id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections#lem:dc-ch2-2-6-unique","title":"lem:dc-ch2-2-6-unique","path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections.md","line":143,"body":"","kind":"lemma","status":"not_started","tex":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections.tex#lem:dc-ch2-2-6-unique","uses":["[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections#def:dc-ch2-2-5]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections#lem:dc-ch2-2-2-coord]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections#lem:dc-ch2-2-6-coeff]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections.tex","label":"lem:dc-ch2-2-6-unique","line":273,"source":"\\begin{lemma}[uniqueness of parallel transport]\n  \\label{lem:dc-ch2-2-6-unique}\n\n  \\uses{def:dc-ch2-2-5, lem:dc-ch2-2-2-coord, lem:dc-ch2-2-6-coeff}\n\n  \\dcref{ch2:2.6}\n  Two parallel coordinate vector fields along the same coordinate curve on\n  $[a,b]$ that agree at $a$ agree throughout $[a,b]$.\n\\end{lemma}\n\\begin{proof}\n  \\sketch\n  Their difference solves the homogeneous linear system (2) with zero initial\n  value. The Lipschitz estimate from \\cref{lem:dc-ch2-2-6-coeff} and\n  Grönwall's inequality imply that it vanishes.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Lemma</div></section>[uniqueness of parallel transport] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6c656d3a64632d6368322d322d362d756e69717565\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections%23def%3Adc-ch2-2-5\">↗ def:dc-ch2-2-5</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections%23lem%3Adc-ch2-2-2-coord\">↗ lem:dc-ch2-2-2-coord</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections%23lem%3Adc-ch2-2-6-coeff\">↗ lem:dc-ch2-2-6-coeff</a> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch2:2.6</span></span>Two parallel coordinate vector fields along the same coordinate curve on <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$[a,b]$\">$[a,b]$</span> that agree at <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$a$\">$a$</span> agree throughout <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$[a,b]$\">$[a,b]$</span>.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p>\\sketch Their difference solves the homogeneous linear system (2) with zero initial value. The Lipschitz estimate from <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections%23lem%3Adc-ch2-2-6-coeff\" data-tex-node=\"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections#lem:dc-ch2-2-6-coeff\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a64632d6368322d322d362d636f656666\">item 3</a> and Grönwall’s inequality imply that it vanishes. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections#lem:dc-ch2-2-6-exist","next":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections#lem:dc-ch2-2-6-transport","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections#def:dc-ch2-2-5","title":"def:dc-ch2-2-5","label":"def:dc-ch2-2-5"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections#lem:dc-ch2-2-2-coord","title":"lem:dc-ch2-2-2-coord","label":"lem:dc-ch2-2-2-coord"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections#lem:dc-ch2-2-6-coeff","title":"lem:dc-ch2-2-6-coeff","label":"lem:dc-ch2-2-6-coeff"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections#prop:dc-ch2-2-6","title":"prop:dc-ch2-2-6","label":"prop:dc-ch2-2-6"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections#lem:dc-ch2-2-6-transport","title":"lem:dc-ch2-2-6-transport","label":"lem:dc-ch2-2-6-transport"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections#prop:dc-ch2-2-6-riemannian","title":"prop:dc-ch2-2-6-riemannian","label":"prop:dc-ch2-2-6-riemannian"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections#lem:dc-ch2-2-6-unique","title":"lem:dc-ch2-2-6-unique","tex":"\\begin{lemma}[uniqueness of parallel transport]\n  \\label{lem:dc-ch2-2-6-unique}\n\n  \\uses{def:dc-ch2-2-5, lem:dc-ch2-2-2-coord, lem:dc-ch2-2-6-coeff}\n\n  \\dcref{ch2:2.6}\n  Two parallel coordinate vector fields along the same coordinate curve on\n  $[a,b]$ that agree at $a$ agree throughout $[a,b]$.\n\\end{lemma}\n\\begin{proof}\n  \\sketch\n  Their difference solves the homogeneous linear system (2) with zero initial\n  value. The Lipschitz estimate from \\cref{lem:dc-ch2-2-6-coeff} and\n  Grönwall's inequality imply that it vanishes.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections#def:dc-ch2-2-5","title":"def:dc-ch2-2-5","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections#lem:dc-ch2-2-2-coord","title":"lem:dc-ch2-2-2-coord","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections#lem:dc-ch2-2-6-coeff","title":"lem:dc-ch2-2-6-coeff","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}